{"id":1120102,"chapter_id":1120102,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"收押的日子一天天逼近，你每天都在尝试利用枷锁来遏制九十九的异化，但效果甚微。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"危机管理局局长，禁闭者九十九的异化程度已经超过临界值，四肢的死役程度也突破60%。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"这意味着她已经无法挽回……而且极为危险。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"鉴于这一情况，FAC必须明令禁止你再接触九十九，并使用枷锁。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"我们不希望因为一个禁闭者，而失去一位伟大的局长。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"……放心，我不会的。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"FAC的调查员对你做了个请的手势，让你离开九十九的禁闭室。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"你思索了一下，决定不和这位“上级领导派来的人员”发生正面冲突，而是去寻找一位能帮上你的“同伴”。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你这是什么意思？","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"options":["你不愿意去见九十九？"],"style":6,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102010,"trial_step":10,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你不愿意去见九十九？","goto":11}]},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呵，我不信，你能有这么好心？肯定是有什么诈！","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"瑟琳","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":14,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":15,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":16,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":17,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":18,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":19,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":20,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":13,"course":6},{"step":21,"content":"九十九现在的情况很危急，但你曾是将她从帕尔马实验室中带出来的人。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102014,"trial_step":14},{"step":22,"content":"我愿意为此赌一把，让你与她见面。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102015,"trial_step":15},{"step":23,"content":"拜托了，海拉。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102016,"trial_step":16},{"step":24,"content":"海拉看到你递出来的文件，立刻跑到了门边。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102017,"trial_step":17},{"step":25,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你怎么不早说！！","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102018,"trial_step":18},{"step":26,"speaker":"海拉","content":"她现在的状况到底怎么样！","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102019,"trial_step":19},{"step":27,"speaker":"海拉","content":"算了，从你嘴里说出来的没有一句好话！我自己亲眼去看看！快带我去！！","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102020,"trial_step":20},{"step":28,"content":"牢门打开，你亲自“押”着海拉前往九十九的禁闭室。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102021,"trial_step":21},{"step":29,"content":"海拉快速地往前走着，你本想多问几句关于九十九的情况，却都被海拉一个白眼堵了回去。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102022,"trial_step":22},{"step":30,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我就知道你会走出这一步棋。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102023,"trial_step":23},{"step":31,"content":"不远处，夜莺拦住了你们的去路。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102024,"trial_step":24},{"step":32,"content":"夜莺，我想尽力试试。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102025,"trial_step":25},{"step":33,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"唉……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102026,"trial_step":26},{"step":34,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"去吧，我会盯住的。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102027,"trial_step":27},{"step":35,"content":"谢谢你。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102028,"trial_step":28},{"step":36,"content":"走过夜莺身边时，你当着夜莺的面，将一个微小的机器发射固定在海拉身上。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102029,"trial_step":29},{"step":37,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九！！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102030,"trial_step":30},{"step":38,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你们怎么把她绑起来了？！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102031,"trial_step":31},{"step":39,"content":"你打开禁闭室的门，海拉立刻走到九十九身边，看着她身上沉重的束缚，怒气冲冲地质问到。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102032,"trial_step":32},{"step":40,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九……别怕，我、我在这呢！你不会有事的……我这就让他们把这该死的东西解开！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102033,"trial_step":33},{"step":41,"content":"所有的束缚都是特制的，虽然被关进这间房子的人都是被判定为超S级危险人员。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102034,"trial_step":34},{"step":42,"content":"但我们也是在尽力缓解她的污染侵蚀。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102035,"trial_step":35},{"step":43,"content":"出于对重要职员的保护，FAC禁止你跟随海拉一同进入房间，你只好留在门口的监控里，随时与她们交流。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102036,"trial_step":36},{"step":44,"speaker":"海拉","content":"她看起来这么痛苦！你……你快给我解开这些东西！我要带她走！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102037,"trial_step":37},{"step":45,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海拉，我没事。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102038,"trial_step":38},{"step":46,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你怎么可能没事呢？！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102039,"trial_step":39},{"step":47,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你现在的样子看上去，比我第一次见你还要狼狈！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102040,"trial_step":40},{"step":48,"speaker":"九十九","content":"当时的你也很狼狈吧。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102041,"trial_step":41},{"step":49,"speaker":"九十九","content":"那时候……我们总是被困在这样黑黑的房子里。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102042,"trial_step":42},{"step":50,"speaker":"九十九","content":"什么都看不见……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102043,"trial_step":43},{"step":51,"content":"————","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102044,"trial_step":44},{"step":52,"speaker":"九十九","content":"……你是谁。","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102045,"trial_step":45},{"step":53,"speaker":"海拉","content":"他们说要把我关在怪物的旁边，难道你就是那只怪物？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102046,"trial_step":46},{"step":54,"speaker":"九十九","content":"可能是吧。","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102047,"trial_step":47},{"step":55,"speaker":"海拉","content":"但你看上去很可爱啊，哪里像怪物了？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102048,"trial_step":48},{"step":56,"content":"————","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102049,"trial_step":49},{"step":57,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我说，你就甘心一直躲在这个地方，每天由着他们让你去打打杀杀？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102050,"trial_step":50},{"step":58,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这破实验室要啥啥没有，还看不见太阳月亮星星，待得太厌烦了！","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102051,"trial_step":51},{"step":59,"speaker":"九十九","content":"太阳……是什么？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102052,"trial_step":52},{"step":60,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊？你没见过吗？你该不会一出生就在这个实验室吧？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102053,"trial_step":53},{"step":61,"speaker":"九十九","content":"可能是吧，所以太阳是什么呢？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102054,"trial_step":54},{"step":62,"speaker":"海拉","content":"太阳就是一个红红的，会发热的大球！没了它人类可能就活不了啦！","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102055,"trial_step":55},{"step":63,"speaker":"九十九","content":"可是我没见过太阳，但我还活着。","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102056,"trial_step":56},{"step":64,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我明白了，我不是人。","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102057,"trial_step":57},{"step":65,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哈哈哈哈哈！你不是人！你是可爱的小怪物！","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102058,"trial_step":58},{"step":66,"speaker":"海拉","content":"那……你要不要和我一起去外面看看太阳？","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102059,"trial_step":59},{"step":67,"speaker":"海拉","content":"就算要当怪物，也要当个自由自在的怪物！","style":1,"background":1039,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102060,"trial_step":60},{"step":68,"content":"————","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102061,"trial_step":61},{"step":69,"speaker":"九十九","content":"这里……这里是外面？！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102062,"trial_step":62},{"step":70,"speaker":"九十九","content":"原来风并不是苦涩的味道……！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102063,"trial_step":63},{"step":71,"speaker":"九十九","content":"人……人也不是只会穿着白色的衣服！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102064,"trial_step":64},{"step":72,"speaker":"海拉","content":"嘿嘿，外面呢，有很多很多你不知道的东西，要好好跟着我，多学习学习，知道吗？","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102065,"trial_step":65},{"step":73,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯，我会跟紧海拉的。","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102066,"trial_step":66},{"step":74,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海拉小心！！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102067,"trial_step":67},{"step":75,"content":"九十九将海拉迅速地拉到自己身后，对着面前的机器人龇牙咧嘴。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102068,"trial_step":68},{"step":76,"speaker":"九十九","content":"别想在我的面前伤害海拉！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102069,"trial_step":69},{"step":77,"content":"无辜的机器人本意只是想捡海拉脚下的垃圾，却被九十九当做是袭击的前兆。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102070,"trial_step":70},{"step":78,"content":"九十九不由分说地朝机器人一刀砍下……","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102071,"trial_step":71},{"step":79,"speaker":"警报声","content":"滴滴滴——有陌生人恶意破坏城市环境维护系统——","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102072,"trial_step":72},{"step":80,"speaker":"海拉","content":"天啊你都干了什么！我们才刚跑出来！我可不想回去关在笼子里！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102073,"trial_step":73},{"step":81,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海拉？海拉我们要去哪里？","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102074,"trial_step":74},{"step":82,"speaker":"海拉","content":"跑啊——！","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102075,"trial_step":75},{"step":83,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哈哈……你那个时候，像个傻子一样。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102076,"trial_step":76},{"step":84,"speaker":"九十九","content":"你还说过……在外面……连树都有可能欺骗你……金色的果子，很酸……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102077,"trial_step":77},{"step":85,"speaker":"海拉","content":"怎么……原来你真的信了啊！难怪你从来不吃芒果和橘子！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102078,"trial_step":78},{"step":86,"speaker":"九十九","content":"但……外面的世界，和你说的一样好玩，阳光灿烂。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102079,"trial_step":79},{"step":87,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我跟着你，真的成为了一个自由自在的怪物……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102080,"trial_step":80},{"step":88,"speaker":"九十九","content":"你让我有了对于自由的向往。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102081,"trial_step":81},{"step":89,"content":"九十九的脸上也布满了因感染而蔓延的黑色纹路，她努力克制着自己暴走的意识，想要将自己的话清晰地传达出来。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102082,"trial_step":82},{"step":90,"speaker":"九十九","content":"让我……一起逃离……逃离帕尔马，逃离我身体里的野兽……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102083,"trial_step":83},{"step":91,"speaker":"海拉","content":"现在也可以！我当初怎么把你从帕尔马带走，现在就能怎样把你从管理局带走！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102084,"trial_step":84},{"step":92,"content":"海拉眼里噙着泪水，恶狠狠地看着你。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102085,"trial_step":85},{"step":93,"speaker":"海拉","content":"不就是个管理局长！我现在就帮你做掉他！","female_content":"不就是个管理局长！我现在就帮你做掉她！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102086,"trial_step":86},{"step":94,"speaker":"九十九","content":"你……真的想对他动手的话……","female_content":"你……真的想对她动手的话……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102087,"trial_step":87},{"step":95,"speaker":"九十九","content":"当初就……不会阻止我。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102088,"trial_step":88},{"step":96,"speaker":"九十九","content":"他对你来说，是很重要的人。","female_content":"她对你来说，是很重要的人。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102089,"trial_step":89},{"step":97,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我也明白……呃……他的善意……","female_content":"我也明白……呃……她的善意……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102090,"trial_step":90},{"step":98,"content":"禁闭室的温度不断升高，这意味着九十九又要陷入思维混沌的暴走之中。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102091,"trial_step":91},{"step":99,"speaker":"九十九","content":"是时候……放弃了。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102092,"trial_step":92},{"step":100,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海拉……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102093,"trial_step":93},{"step":101,"speaker":"海拉","content":"放弃？！连局长都没有放弃你！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102094,"trial_step":94},{"step":102,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九到底是为什么会说出这样的话来！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102095,"trial_step":95},{"step":103,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我怎么会放弃九十九！九十九这个笨蛋！！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102096,"trial_step":96},{"step":104,"content":"特质的拘束链已经无法控制九十九的暴走，整个禁闭室的温度骤然上升。海拉被突如其来的热气一烫，连连向后倒去。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102097,"trial_step":97},{"step":105,"speaker":"九十九","content":"滚……滚开……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102098,"trial_step":98},{"step":106,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九……九十九你个OO！！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102099,"trial_step":99},{"step":107,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海……呃啊啊啊——！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102100,"trial_step":100},{"step":108,"content":"九十九的眼睛充血，理智几乎被高温融化殆尽。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102101,"trial_step":101},{"step":109,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我**的能把你从那个破地方救出来！这次也能把你从这里带走！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102102,"trial_step":102},{"step":110,"speaker":"海拉","content":"别想甩掉我！我就是**的要黏着你一辈子！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102103,"trial_step":103},{"step":111,"speaker":"九十九","content":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102104,"trial_step":104},{"step":112,"options":["冲进禁闭室"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102105,"trial_step":105,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"冲进禁闭室","goto":106}]},{"step":113,"content":"海拉！小心！！！","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102106,"trial_step":106},{"step":114,"content":"九十九暴走了，她举起手边所能拿到的任何东西，朝海拉扔去。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102107,"trial_step":107},{"step":115,"content":"那些乱石，废铁，擦过海拉的脸颊，泪水与血水一起，顺着她的脸庞滑下。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102108,"trial_step":108},{"step":116,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102109,"trial_step":109,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":110}]},{"step":117,"content":"海拉硬撑着，却被一道身影遮住了目光。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102110,"trial_step":110},{"step":118,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你……你怎么进来了！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102111,"trial_step":111},{"step":119,"speaker":"海拉","content":"给我滚开！九十九我会自己救的！！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102112,"trial_step":112},{"step":120,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102113,"trial_step":113,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":114}]},{"step":121,"content":"这样下去你们两个都会没命！！","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102114,"trial_step":114},{"step":122,"speaker":"九十九","content":"吼——————！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102115,"trial_step":115},{"step":123,"content":"你的枷锁被九十九挣脱，猛烈的反噬让你一阵眩晕。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102116,"trial_step":116},{"step":124,"content":"呕——","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102117,"trial_step":117},{"step":125,"content":"被反噬的强烈不适感，让你觉得五脏六腑都被扭在一起，胃部的绞痛和恶心感，让你吐了个昏天黑地。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102118,"trial_step":118},{"step":126,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你……你怎么……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102119,"trial_step":119},{"step":127,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九！你……你再这么下去，我就，我就要打你了！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102120,"trial_step":120},{"step":128,"content":"眼前的人已经完全听不进去任何话了，哪怕是昔日最重视的人在她耳边喊。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102121,"trial_step":121},{"step":129,"content":"你硬撑着起来，按下随身的紧急按钮，随后朝海拉扑去。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102122,"trial_step":122},{"step":130,"options":["拽走海拉"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102123,"trial_step":123,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"拽走海拉","goto":124}]},{"step":131,"content":"海拉的衣领被你揪住，拖着她往外走，眼见没办法挣脱，海拉退而求其次地一拳一拳落在你身上，一通乱打。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102124,"trial_step":124},{"step":132,"content":"没关系的，你要是这样能好受一点，就这样吧。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102125,"trial_step":125},{"step":133,"content":"但我希望你知道，海拉，我不会放弃她的。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102126,"trial_step":126},{"step":134,"content":"三天后——","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102127,"trial_step":127},{"step":135,"content":"海拉……终于安分下来了吗？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102128,"trial_step":128},{"step":136,"content":"你看着凌乱的办公室，吐出一口气。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102129,"trial_step":129},{"step":137,"content":"九十九暴走的当天，FAC就下达了正式转移通知，把九十九带走。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102130,"trial_step":130},{"step":138,"content":"得知这一消息，海拉不顾身上的伤口，从你的医务室，大闹到了所有管理人员的办公室。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102131,"trial_step":131},{"step":139,"content":"直到今天，你终于没有在办公室里，见到那个怒气冲冲的身影了。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102132,"trial_step":132},{"step":140,"options":["询问夜莺"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102133,"trial_step":133,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"询问夜莺","goto":134}]},{"step":141,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"海拉？她从昨天晚上开始，接下了将近六个之前交给她却被她拒绝的任务。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102134,"trial_step":134},{"step":142,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"或许……是想让自己忙一点吧。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102135,"trial_step":135},{"step":143,"content":"……是我没有保护好九十九。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102136,"trial_step":136},{"step":144,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您已经尽力了，现阶段，我们确实没办法对感染到这个程度的禁闭者进行枷锁控制……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102137,"trial_step":137},{"step":145,"content":"那就是我的问题。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102138,"trial_step":138},{"step":146,"content":"我……还不够强大。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102139,"trial_step":139},{"step":147,"content":"如果我的枷锁能够更强的话……九十九是不是就不会被带走……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102140,"trial_step":140},{"step":148,"content":"2小时后——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102141,"trial_step":141},{"step":149,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，刚刚收到通报，海拉脱离了控制，已经逃跑到任务范围之外的地方。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102142,"trial_step":142},{"step":150,"content":"什么？！","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102143,"trial_step":143},{"step":151,"content":"你看着海拉的坐标，突然意识到了什么。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102144,"trial_step":144},{"step":152,"content":"看看她是不是跑到了九十九的封闭车行进路上！","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102145,"trial_step":145},{"step":153,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是……以及局长，她的逃跑时机太过巧合，像是得到了诸多我方行动方案后策划的。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102146,"trial_step":146},{"step":154,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您还记得安装在她身上的窃听器吗？","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102147,"trial_step":147},{"step":155,"content":"你心下一惊，连忙摸了摸自己的口袋，发现里面躺着的正是最初自己放在海拉身上的窃听器。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102148,"trial_step":148},{"step":156,"content":"难道是当时拖她离开九十九的时候……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102149,"trial_step":149},{"step":157,"content":"这些不重要了，她是想去救九十九的，如果这个时候把九十九放出来，海拉会死在她手里的！","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102150,"trial_step":150},{"step":158,"content":"夜莺，马上出发！","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220102151,"trial_step":151}]}